    <h1>GEODE's Multiplayer System</h1>
    <p>A fully implemented server-authoritative networking system for P2P connection in GEODE.</p>
</div>

<article class="case-study">
    <div class="case-meta">
        <div><span class="case-meta-label">Game</span>GEODE</div>
        <div><span class="case-meta-label">My role</span>Solo developer</div>
        <div><span class="case-meta-label">Tools</span>Unity · Netcode for GameObjects · C#</div>
    </div>

    <%# Placeholder clip — swap for a real capture (e.g. 8-player co-op) when recorded. %>
